{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "As a country powerful in maths, China has many creative folk games full of maths wisdom.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "You may play them during a sunny afternoon or on a vacation abroad.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Let's take a look at three of them.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chinese Nine Linked Rings Puzzle",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "It's believed that the Nine Linked Rings puzzle was created in the Western Han Dynasty and may have been played even by the emperor himself.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "It is usually made up of nine rings connected to a handle.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Players have to remove all the rings from the handle to win the game.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "This is not a simple game.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The solution takes 341 moves.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "So lots of effort is required.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "But if you learn to solve it, you'll probably never forget.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Tangram",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "The tangram is a puzzle made up of seven pieces of different shapes, including a square, a parallelogram, and five triangles.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Players need to use all the pieces to make a shape.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "In the 18th century, the tangram was brought to the West and soon gathered international attention.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Today, you can play it on a computer screen or over the Internet.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Luban Lock",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "It is said that the Luban Lock was first created by Lu Ban, who was a famous engineer in ancient China.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "The lock has a lot to do with solid geometry.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "It's hard to separate the six pieces.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "However, it is usually easier to unlock a Luban lock than to fix it back together.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Many people like to collect different kinds of Luban locks, considering them as treasures of Chinese culture.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
